  "evidence_excerpts": [
    {
      "text": "folder 48 - 064\n\nWhen the Xerox missive came I remembered it; here is a case of deja vu opening up into actual anamnesis, + with the unusual fact of my having written much of it down in my novels + stories. In 3-74 I was encountering Valis again. This brings up \"3 Women\" + my reaction to it; I grasped the true situation. We're in irreal worlds + possess false memories but: YHWH is reaching to us with authentic reality. We are in the sort of \"half-life\" Irwelt depicted in \"Ubik.\" Real",
      "matched_alias": "Belial",
      "term_id": "TERM_belial",
      "term_name": "Belial",
      "term_slug": "belial"
    },
    {
      "text": "folder 48 - 065\n\nIt could be said that just as I remembered \"Tears,\" having actually lived then, I also remembered \"Ubik\" only not as clearly. \"Remember\" as a term has an unusual application, here. It is a previous present, not a previous past. This present replaces it, not follows it (in time). It is the role of Ubik/Valis to abolish all this plurality + stabilize into one real world what now shifts + arbitrarily alters. There is no good reason why I am both Thomas + PKD; these are",
      "matched_alias": "Commedia",
      "term_id": "TERM_commedia",
      "term_name": "Commedia",
      "term_slug": "commedia"
    },
    {
      "text": "folder 48 - 067\n\nlevels or rings of being. In \"The Commedia\", they travel upward physically: i.e. spacially. God is not here; he is there (in the sky). This is corrected in \"Ubik.\" It all has to do with a confusion between the pleroma and the cylum, the latter being the vault of heaven. If this error is made, then there exists no conceptual framework to account for the sort of non-spacial rising to a superior -i.e. \"higher\"- level of being in this lifetime (a la Plotinus) while being",
      "matched_alias": "Commedia",
      "term_id": "TERM_commedia",
      "term_name": "Commedia",
      "term_slug": "commedia"
